      "type": "text", "id": "s1_evidence_text", "x": 118, "y": 840, "width": 500, "height": 165,
      "text": "源码证据\nlmcache/integration/vllm/lmcache_mp_connector.py:492\nclass LMCacheMPConnector(KVConnectorBase_V1, SupportsHMA)\n\nregister_kv_caches()  → 注册 IPC + EngineGroupInfo\nget_num_new_matched_tokens() → LOOKUP\nstart_load_kv() → RETRIEVE\nwait_for_save() → STORE", "originalText": "源码证据\nlmcache/integration/vllm/lmcache_mp_connector.py:492\nclass LMCacheMPConnector(KVConnectorBase_V1, SupportsHMA)\n\nregister_kv_caches()  → 注册 IPC + EngineGroupInfo\nget_num_new_matched_tokens() → LOOKUP\nstart_load_kv() → RETRIEVE\nwait_for_save() → STORE",
