      "type": "text", "id": "s3_evidence_text", "x": 1625, "y": 855, "width": 700, "height": 150,
      "text": "L2AdapterInterface 非阻塞契约 · lmcache/v1/distributed/l2_adapters/base.py:78\nsubmit_store_task(keys, objects) → task_id\nsubmit_lookup_and_lock_task(keys, layout) → task_id\nsubmit_load_task(keys, caller-owned buffers) → task_id\nquery_*() → one-shot Bitmap / completion\n\n三个 event fd 必须全局唯一：store · lookup · load", "originalText": "L2AdapterInterface 非阻塞契约 · lmcache/v1/distributed/l2_adapters/base.py:78\nsubmit_store_task(keys, objects) → task_id\nsubmit_lookup_and_lock_task(keys, layout) → task_id\nsubmit_load_task(keys, caller-owned buffers) → task_id\nquery_*() → one-shot Bitmap / completion\n\n三个 event fd 必须全局唯一：store · lookup · load",
