    {
      "type": "text", "id": "s4_config_evidence_text", "x": 145, "y": 1435, "width": 965, "height": 120,
      "text": "Operator 生成的 vLLM discovery contract · operator/internal/resources/configmap.go:41\n{\n  \"kv_connector\": \"LMCacheMPConnector\",\n  \"kv_connector_module_path\": \"lmcache.integration.vllm.lmcache_mp_connector\",\n  \"kv_connector_extra_config\": {\"lmcache.mp.host\": \"tcp://<node-local-service>\", \"lmcache.mp.port\": \"5555\"}\n}", "originalText": "Operator 生成的 vLLM discovery contract · operator/internal/resources/configmap.go:41\n{\n  \"kv_connector\": \"LMCacheMPConnector\",\n  \"kv_connector_module_path\": \"lmcache.integration.vllm.lmcache_mp_connector\",\n  \"kv_connector_extra_config\": {\"lmcache.mp.host\": \"tcp://<node-local-service>\", \"lmcache.mp.port\": \"5555\"}\n}",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 500027, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 500028, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle", "id": "s4_legend", "x": 1220, "y": 1415, "width": 1045, "height": 160,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b", "backgroundColor": "#1e293b", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 500029, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 500030, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "s4_legend_text", "x": 1245, "y": 1435, "width": 995, "height": 120,
      "text": "核心论点\n1. Connector 保留 engine 语义，StorageManager 保留 storage 语义。\n2. 进程内与 MP 最终都把 KV 变成 chunk/ObjectKey + MemoryObj。\n3. 正常 cache miss、timeout、L2 failure 应降级为重算；控制面失败不应破坏推理。\n4. CUDA IPC / SHM / NIXL 是数据面；ZMQ / HTTP / K8s API 是控制或部署面。", "originalText": "核心论点\n1. Connector 保留 engine 语义，StorageManager 保留 storage 语义。\n2. 进程内与 MP 最终都把 KV 变成 chunk/ObjectKey + MemoryObj。\n3. 正常 cache miss、timeout、L2 failure 应降级为重算；控制面失败不应破坏推理。\n4. CUDA IPC / SHM / NIXL 是数据面；ZMQ / HTTP / K8s API 是控制或部署面。",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 500031, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 500032, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
